        'shadows, self-shadowing, ambient occlusion, reflections, or bright highlights into roughness. Do not convert '
        'low-frequency lighting gradients into low-frequency roughness gradients. If the same material appears under '
        'different lighting, keep the roughness similar across those pixels even if the RGB brightness changes '
        'strongly. Infer roughness from material appearance, highlight sharpness, reflection behavior, coating cues, '
